v 3
d roisim: Monte Carlo return-on-investment simulation with tornado export
d
d roisim answers the money question with a range instead of a single
d ratio. It draws each uncertain input (effect, cost, and optionally
d the discount rate and horizon) many times, computes the return on
d investment for every draw, and reports the percentile distribution
d and the break-even probability Pr(ROI > 0). A one-way sensitivity
d sweep, exportable to CSV with saving(), feeds a tornado bar chart
d that shows which assumptions drive the answer.
d
d Requires: Stata 16.0 or newer
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260706
